      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "本設計ではLLMを候補計画生成器、Tool Contract Engineを決定権者、WebMCPを実行界面、Evidence Engineを真偽推定器として分",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "This design separates the LLM as candidate-plan generator, the Tool Contract Eng",
