    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:09f345d0-f5a9-54b1-acb6-90e13cddab07",
      "@type": "spec:ArchitectureDecision",
      "spec:shortId": "ADR-010",
      "uuidV5": "09f345d0-f5a9-54b1-acb6-90e13cddab07",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3b2-7432-886e-c52197d779b9",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "CRDTは可換なデータへ限定し、金融・送信・削除などの副作用には使わない",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Limit CRDT merge to commutative data; do not use it for financial, messaging, or destructive effects",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:46666d42-bcff-5bb9-82cc-0fb4f1f9adc4"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:df667551-a3b4-5140-a293-f6c41fc493c8",
      "@type": "spec:ArchitectureDecision",
      "spec:shortId": "ADR-011",
      "uuidV5": "df667551-a3b4-5140-a293-f6c41fc493c8",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3b3-7493-979a-51788c43cff2",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "JSON-LD/PROV-O/DCAT風の知識グラフを採用するが、単一の公式Open Knowledge Format適合は主張しない",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Use a JSON-LD/PROV-O/DCAT-inspired knowledge graph without claiming conformance to a single official Open Knowledge Format",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:6ea7c25d-7b9e-50b9-9b59-127cd124d5b7"
        },
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:a6ebf827-b311-50da-be6e-c0bbe61838f5"
        },
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:7c4e7328-dbfe-55a6-8365-8783fc8f55c1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:0234e7db-e468-5003-b07d-90416dfb4fb4",
      "@type": "spec:ArchitectureDecision",
      "spec:shortId": "ADR-012",
      "uuidV5": "0234e7db-e468-5003-b07d-90416dfb4fb4",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3b4-7889-a1a2-028c330d9e0f",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "英日を併記し、競合時はmachine-readable JSONと英語規範文を優先する",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Provide English/Japanese text; on conflict, machine-readable JSON and normative English take precedence",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:6ea7c25d-7b9e-50b9-9b59-127cd124d5b7"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:bf03aa47-8e39-54b5-afee-e45f47077ab7",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-ID-001",
      "uuidV5": "bf03aa47-8e39-54b5-afee-e45f47077ab7",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3b5-7568-9dfc-8beeef1b8eb8",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "すべての知識エンティティはcanonical nameとroot namespaceからUUIDv5を持たなければならない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Every knowledge entity MUST have a UUIDv5 derived from its canonical nam",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:dc6a4a7e-d313-5725-8bf7-ef3001781a2e"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:4a5015e0-76b6-57a7-80b8-380bd72c165c",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-ID-002",
      "uuidV5": "4a5015e0-76b6-57a7-80b8-380bd72c165c",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3b6-7cab-af40-a186b3151b3d",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "すべてのイベントはevent timeを反映するUUIDv7を持たなければならない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Every event MUST have a UUIDv7 reflecting its event time.",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:dc6a4a7e-d313-5725-8bf7-ef3001781a2e"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:aeda8d6f-718d-50d7-9871-24d870cc51a5",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-ID-003",
      "uuidV5": "aeda8d6f-718d-50d7-9871-24d870cc51a5",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3b7-7d73-af6a-bb13a512fd54",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "UUIDを認可tokenまたは秘密として扱ってはならない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "UUIDs MUST NOT be treated as authorization tokens or secrets.",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:dc6a4a7e-d313-5725-8bf7-ef3001781a2e"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST NOT"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:680ffb1f-d047-5a44-950e-f0260b063bfc",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-TIME-001",
      "uuidV5": "680ffb1f-d047-5a44-950e-f0260b063bfc",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3b8-71b4-9584-e39da0ee82fc",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "規範時刻はRFC 3339 UTC文字列とepoch_msの両方で保存しなければならない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Normative time MUST be stored as both an RFC 3339 UTC string and epoch_m",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:b50a5b84-01d7-5eed-9304-bb8de74d36fd"
        },
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:e17022d8-a733-5fa9-a23b-e6d4ba08b9ec"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:39b278b2-8c41-5e43-a927-6e9149a9ed2a",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-TIME-002",
      "uuidV5": "39b278b2-8c41-5e43-a927-6e9149a9ed2a",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3b9-7c6d-b1f2-62cbb61f24a2",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "因果順序はhash referenceとsequenceで表し、wall-clockだけに依存してはならない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Causal order MUST be represented by hash references and sequence numbers",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:a6ebf827-b311-50da-be6e-c0bbe61838f5"
        },
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:aa6e88e6-e003-5321-a9ea-689c5e330000"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:48085c9c-c1e1-5716-bc9b-9fd1faa70b52",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-DATA-001",
      "uuidV5": "48085c9c-c1e1-5716-bc9b-9fd1faa70b52",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3ba-7632-a34c-17bcaea4c061",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "Canonical IR、Tool Contract、Audit EventはJSON Schemaで検証されなければならない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Canonical IR, Tool Contract, and Audit Event MUST be validated with JSON",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:d0bc2765-2f7b-534d-a88e-09d1a42cc364"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:cbe0f3e2-8226-5721-8294-4b5ec4c052c2",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-DATA-002",
      "uuidV5": "cbe0f3e2-8226-5721-8294-4b5ec4c052c2",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3bb-7c72-848a-3bc1b2f95683",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "JSONはRFC 8259に適合し、duplicate keyを生成してはならない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "JSON MUST conform to RFC 8259 and MUST NOT contain duplicate object memb",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:2206143d-75e7-5f56-9fd3-7740940f85dc"
        },
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:e17022d8-a733-5fa9-a23b-e6d4ba08b9ec"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:93ebbae2-279e-54a0-b0f0-e28cca717104",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-DATA-003",
      "uuidV5": "93ebbae2-279e-54a0-b0f0-e28cca717104",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3bc-79ed-ac67-d58e61c606dd",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "金額、PPM、sequence、epoch_msなど判定に使う値は整数で表さなければならない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Decision-critical values such as money, PPM, sequence, and epoch_ms MUST",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:e17022d8-a733-5fa9-a23b-e6d4ba08b9ec"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:b9fd8efb-bdb1-5dfc-994e-f5dd07ae8447",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-KNOW-001",
      "uuidV5": "b9fd8efb-bdb1-5dfc-994e-f5dd07ae8447",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3bd-76c6-8458-0f430860359f",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "知識エンティティはJSON-LD graphとしてリンク可能であるべきである。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Knowledge entities SHOULD be linkable as a JSON-LD graph.",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:6ea7c25d-7b9e-50b9-9b59-127cd124d5b7"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "SHOULD"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:d3a81a4e-8c75-5933-ac8f-8dac5126db04",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-KNOW-002",
      "uuidV5": "d3a81a4e-8c75-5933-ac8f-8dac5126db04",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3be-727b-a22c-bc99230531b8",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "claim、formula、requirement、decisionは生成activityとsource provenanceを記録しなければな",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Claims, formulas, requirements, and decisions MUST record generation act",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:a6ebf827-b311-50da-be6e-c0bbe61838f5"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:238898c6-bfc8-59eb-80c1-53d98e630a6a",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-KNOW-003",
      "uuidV5": "238898c6-bfc8-59eb-80c1-53d98e630a6a",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3bf-7bb7-b143-e2feab977c5b",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "distributionとmanifestはDCAT/SPDX風metadataで発見可能にすべきである。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Distributions and manifests SHOULD be discoverable with DCAT/SPDX-style ",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:7c4e7328-dbfe-55a6-8365-8783fc8f55c1"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "SHOULD"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:7f3a824f-08c5-59de-ad8d-4e88d28355e2",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-WEBMCP-001",
      "uuidV5": "7f3a824f-08c5-59de-ad8d-4e88d28355e2",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3c0-7910-bb3e-59cbada496d5",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "WebMCPのdraft APIは専用adapterに隔離しなければならない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "The draft WebMCP API MUST be isolated behind a dedicated adapter.",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:5512b64a-cffd-55db-a665-97f06b0754b3"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:f4f7db8c-c9ce-5e3c-8300-2fa5ac0b620c",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-WEBMCP-002",
      "uuidV5": "f4f7db8c-c9ce-5e3c-8300-2fa5ac0b620c",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3c1-739d-9995-00f458dc7b9a",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "plannerへ公開する前にtool discoveryとcontract lookupを実行しなければならない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Tool discovery and contract lookup MUST occur before tools are exposed t",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:5512b64a-cffd-55db-a665-97f06b0754b3"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:a629f2cd-de50-58db-8efe-19fdda073067",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-WEBMCP-003",
      "uuidV5": "a629f2cd-de50-58db-8efe-19fdda073067",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3c2-7010-a00d-bdbbcf6a5797",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "hard gateに失敗したtoolはplannerの候補集合から除外しなければならない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "A tool that fails a hard gate MUST be removed from the planner candidate",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:5512b64a-cffd-55db-a665-97f06b0754b3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:0040f552-6e8a-555a-8d77-ff88cf190932"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:bd72b9e2-33af-5678-8fbe-cd7a7d76e91c",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-MCP-001",
      "uuidV5": "bd72b9e2-33af-5678-8fbe-cd7a7d76e91c",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3c3-7c30-817e-9438632026b2",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "MCP経由のtoolでもhost policyとuser consentを迂回してはならない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Tools reached through MCP MUST NOT bypass host policy or user consent.",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:0040f552-6e8a-555a-8d77-ff88cf190932"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:cf6475e2-d1a3-53aa-8f76-a4deddaee41e",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-PLAN-001",
      "uuidV5": "cf6475e2-d1a3-53aa-8f76-a4deddaee41e",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3c4-7580-825b-b843513ad623",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "Responses APIはoptional plannerであり、system availabilityの単一障害点にしてはならない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "The Responses API MUST be an optional planner and MUST NOT be a single p",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:cc769e2e-dd5a-5e6c-9846-a6e255180914"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:d2ad6445-26da-572e-b6b7-68a816e97a73",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-PLAN-002",
      "uuidV5": "d2ad6445-26da-572e-b6b7-68a816e97a73",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3c5-7e52-98b5-6d3bb13ddc2c",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "remote MCPまたはResponses tool exposureはfeasible toolだけに限定しなければならない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Remote MCP or Responses tool exposure MUST be limited to feasible tools.",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:c3559101-59f2-508b-9f90-f095310c8865"
        },
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:0040f552-6e8a-555a-8d77-ff88cf190932"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:687f6076-94c1-561c-8c54-14d1c037d9c9",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-PLAN-003",
      "uuidV5": "687f6076-94c1-561c-8c54-14d1c037d9c9",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3c6-75d6-bbf7-f92b00f436dd",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "planner出力はcandidate proposalであり、authorizationを生成してはならない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Planner output MUST be treated as a candidate proposal and MUST NOT crea",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:695b8f5a-ed77-5c3c-b9a7-7d8573f622c5"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:8b7b9add-4954-55f0-9c5e-91cec57d08d2",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-TOOL-001",
      "uuidV5": "8b7b9add-4954-55f0-9c5e-91cec57d08d2",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3c7-7f52-a14b-0a4e7d24e253",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "各toolはinput、precondition、transition、postcondition、cost、risk、evidenceのcon",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Each tool MUST have a contract covering input, preconditions, transition",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:d0bc2765-2f7b-534d-a88e-09d1a42cc364"
        },
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:5512b64a-cffd-55db-a665-97f06b0754b3"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:a3a103a7-322f-5d42-ba54-3c247f254115",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-TOOL-002",
      "uuidV5": "a3a103a7-322f-5d42-ba54-3c247f254115",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3c8-73e0-83ab-a86750544f06",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "mutation toolはdeclared read setとwrite setを持たなければならない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Mutation tools MUST declare read and write sets.",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:f5c97a48-75c1-5e0f-82e6-c989fdc2ea7d"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:8d089165-35cd-542d-a9a8-a4f19c97835e",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-TOOL-003",
