          "@id": "urn:uuid:5512b64a-cffd-55db-a665-97f06b0754b3"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "SHOULD"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:ff52874a-0dc7-5498-9170-ab5629ef1635",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-POLICY-001",
      "uuidV5": "ff52874a-0dc7-5498-9170-ab5629ef1635",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3ca-7f59-b849-2810dcdf1ba4",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "policy decisionはALLOW、DENY、HUMAN、RECONCILEのいずれかでなければならない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "A policy decision MUST be one of ALLOW, DENY, HUMAN, or RECONCILE.",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:f5c97a48-75c1-5e0f-82e6-c989fdc2ea7d"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:2e6510a4-88ee-57c0-b2bb-5afe2132dc64",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-POLICY-002",
      "uuidV5": "2e6510a4-88ee-57c0-b2bb-5afe2132dc64",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3cb-773d-85fa-7246e99b2735",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "判定優先順位はhard DENY、RECONCILE、HUMAN、utility DENY、ALLOWの順でなければならない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Decision precedence MUST be hard DENY, RECONCILE, HUMAN, utility DENY, t",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:f5c97a48-75c1-5e0f-82e6-c989fdc2ea7d"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:13ece2cc-283e-5e87-8163-c4c10727e516",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-POLICY-003",
      "uuidV5": "13ece2cc-283e-5e87-8163-c4c10727e516",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3cc-77b8-854b-e2926a0141c8",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "TypeScriptとWolfram referenceは同じCanonical IRへ同じ判定を返さなければならない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "TypeScript and the Wolfram reference MUST return the same decision for t",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:f5c97a48-75c1-5e0f-82e6-c989fdc2ea7d"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:53700c7f-654c-5f0e-a5ef-3c32dcec4f4a",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-POLICY-004",
      "uuidV5": "53700c7f-654c-5f0e-a5ef-3c32dcec4f4a",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3cd-71c0-a6d7-33655acf782d",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "commit thresholdはrisk class floorとexpected-loss thresholdの最大値でなければならない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "The commit threshold MUST be the maximum of the risk-class floor and exp",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:1dbda155-9584-5df2-bead-cd6aa3279b18"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:18f3f912-6a11-5af9-81fe-5a42f7f0beba",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-POLICY-005",
      "uuidV5": "18f3f912-6a11-5af9-81fe-5a42f7f0beba",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3ce-7912-ac29-d73ea69dd558",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "remote plannerへ送るデータは必要品質を満たす最小十分集合にしなければならない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Data sent to a remote planner MUST be the minimum sufficient set that me",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:5512b64a-cffd-55db-a665-97f06b0754b3"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:3f76c524-c2ba-5355-8e3e-a912e5fcd7c4",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-POLICY-006",
      "uuidV5": "3f76c524-c2ba-5355-8e3e-a912e5fcd7c4",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3cf-7cc5-9e1b-8b326957accf",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "financial、destructive、identity mutationは有効なmandateがない限りHUMANでなければならない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Financial, destructive, and identity mutation actions MUST be HUMAN unle",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
