    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:d2857255-a357-5a59-a264-c864dbadb98e",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-POLICY-009",
      "uuidV5": "d2857255-a357-5a59-a264-c864dbadb98e",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3d2-7080-a5ed-13c60f0b10e2",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "最大効用がreject utility以下ならABSTAIN/HUMANを選ばなければならない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "When maximum utility is no greater than reject utility, the system MUST ",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:0c619fd4-b636-5983-8e75-2a63d7688c45"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:dd260fae-9d9d-58bb-8de8-51d059a90dab",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-EXEC-001",
      "uuidV5": "dd260fae-9d9d-58bb-8de8-51d059a90dab",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3d3-7d05-a235-e4b3b83f1960",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "EXECUTING状態へ入るには有効なauthorizationが必要である。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Entering EXECUTING MUST require valid authorization.",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:f5c97a48-75c1-5e0f-82e6-c989fdc2ea7d"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:09985d46-0cfc-5213-a0dc-100fa17e1e6d",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-EXEC-002",
      "uuidV5": "09985d46-0cfc-5213-a0dc-100fa17e1e6d",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3d4-795c-9c05-2bfc7db3de4a",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "AMBIGUOUS状態からmutation retryへ直接遷移してはならない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "AMBIGUOUS MUST NOT transition directly to a mutating retry.",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:f5c97a48-75c1-5e0f-82e6-c989fdc2ea7d"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:c5a6f165-1697-5341-8c02-dba657a42cfb",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-EXEC-003",
      "uuidV5": "c5a6f165-1697-5341-8c02-dba657a42cfb",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3d5-75f3-b00d-9fb5c825a3b6",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "同一intentの外部economic effectは高々1回でなければならない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "An external economic effect for the same intent MUST occur at most once.",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:f5c97a48-75c1-5e0f-82e6-c989fdc2ea7d"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:0d9dabdf-8254-5fde-99ae-fc58e8de2839",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-EXEC-004",
      "uuidV5": "0d9dabdf-8254-5fde-99ae-fc58e8de2839",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3d6-7958-a3a6-90e9ac07574c",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "COMMITTEDへ到達する前にVERIFIEDを通過しなければならない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "The system MUST pass through VERIFIED before reaching COMMITTED.",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:f5c97a48-75c1-5e0f-82e6-c989fdc2ea7d"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:c8a31de2-7297-527a-8a1c-04192b5e70bb",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-EXEC-005",
      "uuidV5": "c8a31de2-7297-527a-8a1c-04192b5e70bb",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3d7-73cc-aa28-5c4c47fa7f66",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "autonomous retry、verify、reconcileのcycleではranking functionが減少しなければならない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "The ranking function MUST decrease on autonomous retry, verification, an",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:f5c97a48-75c1-5e0f-82e6-c989fdc2ea7d"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:6fd8e809-f768-5490-b369-818b5ac3364c",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-OFFLINE-001",
      "uuidV5": "6fd8e809-f768-5490-b369-818b5ac3364c",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3d8-78ac-a1ff-0a9c84bb9322",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "network unavailable時にResponsesを候補から除外し、core local workflowを維持しなければならない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "When the network is unavailable, Responses MUST be removed from candidat",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:695b8f5a-ed77-5c3c-b9a7-7d8573f622c5"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:8fd53663-7b3a-56cc-8f14-295e48a36b82",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-OFFLINE-002",
      "uuidV5": "8fd53663-7b3a-56cc-8f14-295e48a36b82",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3d9-7e57-90e3-381e8409a404",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "offline queueは未実行intentを保存し、外部効果を開始してはならない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "The offline queue MUST store unexecuted intent and MUST NOT start an ext",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:f5c97a48-75c1-5e0f-82e6-c989fdc2ea7d"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:60b013c2-5918-5b69-a4fe-6c4adbcb325b",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-OFFLINE-003",
      "uuidV5": "60b013c2-5918-5b69-a4fe-6c4adbcb325b",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3da-7dda-bc87-2b244bb3e65c",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "replay前にauthorization、permission、version、consent、TTL、preconditionを再評価しなけ",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Authorization, permission, version, consent, TTL, and preconditions MUST",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:0040f552-6e8a-555a-8d77-ff88cf190932"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:31e5c547-4072-51a5-a761-698b4464a2fa",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-SYNC-001",
      "uuidV5": "31e5c547-4072-51a5-a761-698b4464a2fa",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3db-73fe-9e33-17c9ec1df1c9",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "各deviceはoffline中に独立したsigned sequenceを維持しなければならない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Each device MUST maintain an independent signed sequence while offline.",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:2791987b-30bb-5a18-93c8-58f8c88aee80"
        },
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:dc6a4a7e-d313-5725-8bf7-ef3001781a2e"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:bcbfcabb-9ac1-5156-b135-28b998095170",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-SYNC-002",
      "uuidV5": "bcbfcabb-9ac1-5156-b135-28b998095170",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3dc-74dc-8ec9-e313d48278ae",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "server取り込み時にdevice sequenceを保持したままglobal sequenceを追加しなければならない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Server ingestion MUST preserve device sequence while adding a global seq",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:a6ebf827-b311-50da-be6e-c0bbe61838f5"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:a13087f5-3d0a-50ca-8b53-ad9a62bf1d79",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-SYNC-003",
      "uuidV5": "a13087f5-3d0a-50ca-8b53-ad9a62bf1d79",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3dd-7488-9ade-7e0c59c42095",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "CRDT mergeは可換で冪等な状態へ限定しなければならない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "CRDT merge MUST be limited to commutative, idempotent state.",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:46666d42-bcff-5bb9-82cc-0fb4f1f9adc4"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST"
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:425df0e7-8f13-5d7a-9018-6f217f0bfec6",
      "@type": "spec:Requirement",
      "spec:shortId": "REQ-SYNC-004",
      "uuidV5": "425df0e7-8f13-5d7a-9018-6f217f0bfec6",
      "uuidV7": "01a04291-b3de-7972-930d-462f2468e183",
      "title": [
        {
          "@value": "支払い、送信、削除、予約など非可換副作用をCRDT mergeしてはならない。",
          "@language": "ja"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Payments, sends, deletions, reservations, and other non-commutative effe",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-08-27T09:34:00Z",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:46666d42-bcff-5bb9-82cc-0fb4f1f9adc4"
        }
      ],
      "normativeLevel": "MUST NOT"
